      'The Google Data Analytics Certificate and the IBM Data Analyst Professional Certificate are both structured, self-paced options that typically take three to six months and cost a fraction of a full postgraduate diploma. Judge the specific course content, not the brand name — check the syllabus, project depth, and what you will actually be able to show afterward.',
