  {
    label: 'Going deeper',
    title: 'A structured diploma is the next step if the fit is real',
    body:
      'Programmes such as an executive diploma with live mentorship and a cohort (roughly a year, part-time) make sense only after a short certificate has confirmed genuine interest — not as the first thing you try.',
